            <RURComments xml:space="preserve">
                <airSeal>The electrical panel is showing signs of air leakage. 



There is air entering through electrical receptacles such as outlets and light switches. 



The attic hatch needs a better seal on it to prevent air from entering.</airSeal>
                <ceilings>The ceiling is in need of an upgrade. I suggested adding R-30 of blown in cellulose insulation on top of the existing R-20 batt. </ceilings>
                <exposedFloors>This could be a potenital place for upgrade. Though there is not a lot of exposed floor, it can still be an area of heat loss. </exposedFloors>
                <windows>The windows could all be upgraded to Energy Star windows rated for the north. The windows are triple paned already and are not showing signs of deteriorating. It is not a priority at the moment.</windows>
                <doors>The back door is very leaky and should be replaced.</doors>
            </RURComments>
        </Options>
